This privacy policy pertains to the Sombrio app.

Sombrio does not collect any personal information. It connects to the media servers you sign in to (Jellyfin or Emby,
or for music also Navidrome and other Subsonic servers), to GitHub to look for newer builds of the app, and, when your
server has no lyrics for a song, to LRCLIB (lrclib.net), which it sends the song's title, artist, album and length.
Looking up lyrics on LRCLIB can be turned off in the music player's settings (Layout & Theme, Lyrics). Services you
choose to use, like ratings from MDBList or TMDB or requests through Seerr, are reached through your server or with
the keys you give them. No identifying information or user data of any kind is made available to anyone else.

Sombrio is built on Moonfin and sombrAMP, which is built on Finamp.
